return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Ó ń gbé àkójọ faili amóhùnmáwòrán ti ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lọ sí ibi-ìpamọ́ nǹkan ti Zinn® tí ó sì ń pèsè rẹ̀ láti CDN kan. A tò lẹ́sẹẹsẹ láti inú àpótí ìṣàkóso Zinn® rẹ — kò sí kókóro ìwọlé kankan tí a máa tẹ̀ sínú WordPress rárá.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Ti fipamọ́. Tẹ iye titun kan lati rọ́pò rẹ̀.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ́ àkójọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Ṣẹ àtòjọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí ó bá àyọ̀ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Fi ìlà kan kún un','Remove this row'=>'Yọ oriilẹ yii kuro','Remove'=>'Yọ kúrò','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Akopọ','Copied'=>'A daakọ rẹ̀','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo ohun-itanna Zinn® lori aaye yii, ati boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Kò sí àsopọ̀ kankan tí a nílò fún àfikún yìí.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati yi awọn eto wọnyi pada.','Settings sections'=>'Àwọn abala ètò','Support'=>'Atilẹyin','Save changes'=>'Fi àwọn àyípadà pamọ́','Tools'=>'Àwọn Irinṣẹ́','Export settings'=>'Kó àwọn ètò jáde','Reset to defaults'=>'Tunto si àwọn àkọ́kọ́','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò da gbogbo ètò lórí àfikún yìí padà sí ti àkọ́bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ṣé kí a tẹ̀síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Àyẹ̀wò fún àtìlẹ́yìn','Import a settings file'=>'Kó fáìlì àwọn ètò wọlé','Import'=>'Gbewọle','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Awọn faili ti a firanṣẹ si oke ko ni awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle, awọn ami tabi awọn bọtini API ninu — iwọ yoo nilo lati tẹ wọn sii lẹẹkansi lori aaye tuntun naa.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ètò pamọ́.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lórí àfikún yìí ti padà sí àbùdá rẹ̀.','Done.'=>'Ti parí.','That action is not available.'=>'Iṣẹ́ yẹn kò sí.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Kò le ka fáìlì yẹn. Yan fáìlì àwọn ètò tí a gbé jáde láti inú àfikún Zinn® kan.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn tóbi jù láti jẹ́ àkójọ ìgbéjáde àwọn ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kì í ṣe ìmúdájú àwọn ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'A ṣe àgbéwọle fáìlì yẹn láti inú ohun-ìtìlẹ́yìn míràn (%s), nítorí náà mímú wọlé síhìn-ín yóò fi àwọn ètò tí ohun-ìtìlẹ́yìn yìí kò yé pamọ́.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'A ti gbe ètò %d wọlé. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé àti kókó API kì í wà nínú ìgbéjáde rárá, nítorí náà ẹ tún wọn tẹ̀ sii.','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò dá àmì padà. Kò sí ohun tí a yípadà lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Aaye yii ko ni asopọ mọ pẹlu gbigbe faili media sita Zinn®. Awọn ikojade titun yoo wa lori olupin yii. So pọ mọ lẹẹkansi lati inu dasibodu Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® dahun pẹlu HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ti ge asopọ nipasẹ Zinn Digital®.','Connected'=>'Ti so pọ','Connecting…'=>'Ún sopọ̀…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'A ti so pọ̀, ṣùgbọ́n nǹkan kan nílò àfiyèsí','Not connected'=>'A ko sopọ','Running on your own account'=>'Nṣiṣẹ lori akọọlẹ ti ara rẹ','We could not check this'=>'A kò lè yẹ èyí wò','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Àfikún yìí kò sọ ìdí rẹ̀. Ẹ fi ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò ránṣẹ́ a ó sì yẹ̀ ẹ́ wò.','Connection status'=>'Ipò ìsopọ̀','Last checked %s ago.'=>'A yẹ ẹ wò kẹ́yìn ni %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ṣi si taabu tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi èyí ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí gan-an ni ohun tí a óò fi ránṣẹ́ — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sì sí ohun tí a fi pamọ́. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé, àwọn tókẹ̀nì àti àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API rẹ kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ìjábọ̀ àyẹ̀wò tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣe àwòkọ sí pátákó ìpamọ́','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ìròyìn yìí ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A máa ń ṣí tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì ìtìlẹ́yìn fún yín, a sì máa ń fèsì nípasẹ̀ e-meeli. Tí ẹ kò bá fẹ́ fi ránṣẹ́, ẹ da kọ láti òkè kí ẹ sì lẹ̀ mọ́ inú tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì fúnra yín.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital® lati olupin yii (%s). Da iroyin ti o wa loke kọ ki o si ṣi tiketi kan dipo — ko si ohun ti o buru nipa awọn eto rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Ti firanṣẹ. Atilẹyin Zinn® ti gba ijabọ rẹ ati pe yoo dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Ti firanṣẹ. Atilẹyin Zinn® ti gba ijabọ rẹ — itọkasi %s — yoo si dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'O ti fi ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìròyìn ránṣẹ́ láàárín àkókò kúkúrú. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí o sì gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i — àwọn ti tẹ́lẹ̀ ti dé.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò le gba ìròyìn náà wọlé ní báyìí — àbùkù náà wá láti ọ̀dọ̀ wa, kì í ṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ yín. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi láìpẹ́, tàbí kí ẹ ṣe ẹ̀dà ìròyìn tó wà lókè yìí sínú tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'A kọ ijabọ naa (HTTP %d). Daakọ loke ki o si ṣi tikẹti kan, pẹlu titọka nọmba yẹn.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà àti iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà aṣàmúlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi èyí pamọ́','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Alejo Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣílọ ọ̀fẹ́ àti pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tó ju ẹyọ kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ki o si ta awọn aaye ti a ti fi idi rẹ mulẹ, awọn orukọ ìkànnì ati awọn ibi ifibọ ọna asopọ, pẹlu idaduro owo ni aabo titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba àwọn ènìyàn tí iṣẹ́ yìí jẹ́ ohun ìgbésí ayé wọn síṣẹ́','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà iṣẹ́-alágbàṣe àgbáyé wa: ṣàwárí àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a ti ṣe tán tí ó ju 10,000 lọ láti ọwọ́ àwọn olùkọ̀wé, àwọn olùṣe àpẹẹrẹ, àwọn olùgbédàgbà àti àwọn amòye SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ kan síta kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n dídìelélórí.','Media Offload'=>'Ìgbéwọlé Media Sode','Connection'=>'Ìsopọ̀','What gets moved'=>'Kí ló ń lọ','How media is served'=>'Bí a ṣe ń pèsè amóhùnmáwòrán','Move a batch now'=>'Gbe ipele kan báyìí','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'Mídíà tí a ti gbé kò ní ní ipa kankan láti ọ̀dọ̀ àyípadà níbí — àdírẹ́sì rẹ̀ kì yóò yípadà.','New uploads'=>'Àwọn ìrùsókè tuntun','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'Gbe awọn ikojọpọ titun si ibi ipamọ Zinn® bi wọn ṣe n de','Existing media'=>'Awon faili amohun-maworan to wa','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'Tẹsiwaju lati gbe ile-ikawe media ti o wa nibi tẹlẹ','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'Awọn faili diẹ ni wakati kan, ni abẹlẹ, n tẹsiwaju lati ibiti o ti duro. Piparẹ eyi yoo da duro; ko si ohun ti a ti gbe tẹlẹ ti yoo pada wa.','Files per hourly pass'=>'Àwọn fáìlì fún ìkọjá ti wákàtí kọ̀ọ̀kan','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'Ìsomọ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan jẹ́ ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ fáìlì àti pé ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan jẹ́ ìrùsókè kíkún. Ṣe àlékún rẹ̀ lórí ẹ̀rọ agbàlejò tó yára pẹ̀lú ààlà àkókò ìgbéṣẹ́ tó pọ̀; dín in kù bí àwọn ìpele bá ń kùnà tàbí tí wọ́n ń ké kúrú.','Leave files smaller than'=>'Fi àwọn fáìlì tó kéré ju sílẹ̀','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'Àwọn kilobaiti. Àmì kékeré kan máa ń náwó lórí ìsopọ̀ àfikún ju bí ó ṣe ń fi ààyè pamọ́ sí orí àwo-ìpamọ́ lọ, nítorí náà kò fi bẹ́ẹ̀ sí ìdí láti gbé e. Ṣètò sí 0 láti gbé ohun gbogbo.','Never move these types'=>'Ma ṣe gbe awọn iru wọnyi rara','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'Wulo nigbati afikun ba ka faili kan taara lati inu awo-fọto — fonti kan, PDF ti oluṣe fọọmu fi ami si, faili ohun ti ẹrọ orin n wa ninu rẹ.','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'Awọn meji wọnyi ni awọn ti o yẹ ki a ṣọra pẹlu — ka apejuwe kọọkan ṣaaju ki o to yi pada.','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'Pese lati ibi ipamọ Zinn®','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'Tọ́ka àwọn àdírẹ́sì àwòrán àti fáìlì sí ibi ìpamọ́ Zinn®','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'Paa, a ti gbe awọn faili si ori ayelujara ṣugbọn a ṣi n pin wọn lati ori olupin yii — eyiti o jẹ ipo to ni aabo lakoko ti ẹ n rii daju pe ohun gbogbo ti de. Tan, a n pin fun awọn alejo lati ibi ipamọ ati pe olupin yii n da didari ijabọ duro.','Free the disk space'=>'Ṣe àyè disk di ofo','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'Pa ẹda agbegbe rẹ rẹ ni kete ti gbogbo iwọn ba ti gbe soke','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'Èyí ni kókó ìrùkúrò, ó sì tún jẹ́ ìdajì tí kò ṣeé yípadà. Fi sílẹ̀ ní pípa títí tí “Serve from Zinn® storage” yóò fi wà ní tàn tí ẹ sì ti yẹ ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yín wò — ẹ̀dà àbínibí kan ṣoṣo ni ohun tí ó lè gbà yín là tí nǹkan kan bá ti fò kọjá.','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'A ko le yi piparẹ awọn adakọ agbegbe pada lati oju-iboju yii. Ṣe afẹyinti kọkọ — afikun Zinn® Connector le ṣe iyẹn fun ọ.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'Aaye yii ko tii sopọ mọ ibi ipamọ Zinn®, nitorinaa ko si ibiti a le gbe media lọ si.','%d attachment moved.'=>'A ti gbe àsomọ́ %d.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'Aaye yii ko ni asopọ si ibi ipamọ Zinn®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bàjẹ́ — a kàn kò tíì so pọ̀ ni. Àwọn amóhùnmáwòrán yóò wà lórí ẹ̀rọ-ìpèsè yìí títí di ìgbà náà.','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣugbọn ikojọpọ to kẹhin kuna.','Try a batch now'=>'Dán ìpele kan wò báyìí','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'Ti sopọ̀. Gbogbo àsomọ́ ni a ti gbé kúrò.','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'Ti sopọ. %1$s ninu %2$s awọn asomọ ṣi wa lori olupin yii.','Moved so far'=>'A ti gbe e titi di isisiyi','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'àwọn fáìlì %1$s, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Ṣì wà lórí olupin yìí','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s nínú %2$s àwọn àsomọ́','Served from'=>'Pèsè láti','this server'=>'sáfà yìí','Connect this site'=>'So ojúlé yìí pọ̀','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, choose this site, open Files & databases, and press “Get a pairing code” under Images & video CDN. Paste the code below.'=>'Ṣí pátákó ìṣàkóso Zinn Digital® rẹ, yan ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, ṣí Files & databases, kí o sì tẹ “Get a pairing code” lábẹ́ Images & video CDN. Lẹ koodu náà sí ìsàlẹ̀.','Pairing code'=>'Kóòdù ìsopọ̀','Disconnect this site'=>'Ge asopọ aaye yii','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Awọn ikojade tuntun yoo wa lori olupin yii. Awọn faili amohun-maworan ti a ti gbe tẹlẹ yoo tẹsiwaju lati ṣiṣẹ — adirẹsi wọn ko yipada.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati ṣakoso aaye yii.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Lẹ koodu isopọ lati dasibodu Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'Ti sopọ. Awọn ikojade titun yoo wa ni ipamọ pẹlu Zinn Digital® lati isisiyi lọ, ati pe awọn faili media rẹ ti o wa tẹlẹ yoo gbe ni abẹlẹ.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'A ti ge asopọ kuro. Awọn amugbooro ti a ti gbe tẹlẹ yoo ma tẹsiwaju lati ṣiṣẹ; awọn ikojade tuntun yoo duro lori olupin yii.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'A kò le ka faili yẹn lati ori olupin yii, nitorina ko si ohun ti a gbe sori ayelujara.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Aaye yii ko le san ikojọpọ naa, nitorinaa ko si ohun ti a firanṣẹ.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Fáìlì yìí jẹ́ %1$s àti pé PHP ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kò ní cURL, nítorí náà èyí tí ó tóbi jùlọ tí ó lè gbé sókè jẹ́ %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Ìrànṣẹ́-sókè kò lè parí.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Ibùfipamọ́ kọ ìrànṣẹ́gòkè náà (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Tito ara tẹlẹ','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ojuami ibẹrẹ kan. Ohunkohun ti o wa ni isalẹ bori rẹ.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo àwọ̀ àti ìwọ̀n ti ara mi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi èyí sílẹ̀ ní pípa tì kò sì ní yí ohun tí a ti tò tẹ́lẹ̀ padà.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkíyèsí àtújáde Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìfidàtuntun Zinn® kò pèsè ìsopọ̀ ìgbasílẹ̀ fún ìfidàtuntun yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè dé orí pèpéle Zinn®, lẹ́yìn náà kí o tún gbìyànjú.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kò le ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn naa lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Tun gbiyanju lẹhin iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tí a gbàsílẹ̀ kùn nínú àyẹ̀wò ìdúróṣinṣin rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sípò.']];